{'symbol': 'FRC', 'date': '2022-08-22 09:00:00', 'title': 'WEALTH MANAGEMENT TEAM LED BY RADHIKA MEHTA AND NICK FANNERON JOINS FIRST REPUBLIC', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FIRST REPUBLIC BANK (NYSE:FRC), A LEADING PRIVATE BANK AND WEALTH MANAGEMENT COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT RADHIKA MEHTA AND NICK FANNERON HAVE JOINED FIRST REPUBLIC INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT IN NEW YORK. MEHTA WAS NAMED MANAGING DIRECTOR AND WEALTH MANAGER AND FANNERON WAS NAMED VICE PRESIDENT AND WEALTH MANAGER. THE TEAM WILL PROVIDE PORTFOLIO MANAGEMENT, RETIREMENT PLANNING, INVESTMENT CONSULTING AND OTHER WEALTH MANAGEMENT SERVICES TO INDIVIDUALS, FAMILIES, NONPR'}